cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these transforms, please cite them as below."
title: "srfm-core: SRFM bar transforms (Minkowski beta, black-hole mass, geodesic, Hawking z)"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Busel
    given-names: Matthew
version: 0.1.1
date-released: 2026-11-15
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Mattbusel/srfm-core"
keywords:
  - technical analysis
  - trading indicators
  - quantitative finance
  - time series
abstract: >-
  Reference definitions and implementations (Python and Rust) of the SRFM bar
  transforms from srfm-lab: per-bar Minkowski beta (TIMELIKE / SPACELIKE
  classification against a speed-of-light return cf), black-hole mass (a
  decaying accumulator of ordered momentum with formation and collapse
  thresholds), a rolling log-linear geodesic with causal fraction, and a
  Bollinger-z Hawking proxy. Ships golden test vectors generated from the
  original implementation.
references:
